These changes:

- Add a always‐white background via `styles.backgroundDefault`  
- Swap the old “icon tint only” active classes to `styles.backgroundSelected`  
- Leave the disabled styling untouched  

Once you have those classes in your CSS (white for default, blue for selected), your “Show/Hide” and rotation‐style buttons will be much more distinguishable in grayscale.
